{"id":"dc7a86008fec71df","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-sheaf.md","title":"df-sheaf","display":"df-sheaf","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-sheaf","aliases":["16-df-sheaf","Sheaf for a nucleus"],"display":"df-sheaf","depends_on":["[[16-df-separated]]","[[16-df-nucleus]]","[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[16-df-category]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-sheaf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-sheaf</span><span>Sheaf for a nucleus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sheaf"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3878d9cc72edc34\" href=\"?note=e3878d9cc72edc34\" title=\"16-df-separated\">16-df-separated</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7b9d7a3ecba84e9e\" href=\"?note=7b9d7a3ecba84e9e\" title=\"16-df-nucleus\">16-df-nucleus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55e78399bad5fbe9\" href=\"?note=55e78399bad5fbe9\" title=\"16-df-subobject-classifier\">16-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega\">\\(j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7b9d7a3ecba84e9e\" href=\"?note=7b9d7a3ecba84e9e\" title=\"16-df-nucleus\">16-df-nucleus</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nucleus}_\\Omega(j)\">\\(\\mathrm{Nucleus}_\\Omega(j)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top:1\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\top:1\\to\\Omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_m:A\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\chi_m:A\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"55e78399bad5fbe9\" href=\"?note=55e78399bad5fbe9\" title=\"16-df-subobject-classifier\">16-df-subobject-classifier</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_A=\\top\\circ!_A\">\\(\\top_A=\\top\\circ!_A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!_A\">\\(!_A\\)</span> 为唯一终态射。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dense}_j\">\\(\\mathrm{Dense}_j\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e3878d9cc72edc34\" href=\"?note=e3878d9cc72edc34\" title=\"16-df-separated\">16-df-separated</a>。下文满子范畴的Hom只在其所定义对象上使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sheaf}_j\">\\(\\mathrm{Sheaf}_j\\)</span> 是下文定义的性质。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E=\\langle O,M,s,t,e,c\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal E=\\langle O,M,s,t,e,c\\rangle\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a> 的六元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^{(2)}=\\{(g,f)\\in M^2\\mid s(g)=t(f)\\}\">\\(M^{(2)}=\\{(g,f)\\in M^2\\mid s(g)=t(f)\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 在满子范畴的 Hom 公式中取自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_{\\mathrm{Sh}}\">\\(O_{\\mathrm{Sh}}\\)</span>；其箭头保留环境范畴的源、靶与复合。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sheaf}_j(X)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall U,A)(\\forall m:U\\rightarrowtail A)\\bigl[\\mathrm{Dense}_j(m)\\Rightarrow\n(\\forall f:U\\to X)(\\exists!h:A\\to X)\\ hm=f\\bigr],\\\\\nO_{\\mathrm{Sh}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{X\\in O\\mid\\mathrm{Sheaf}_j(X)\\},\\\\\nM_{\\mathrm{Sh}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{f\\in M\\mid s(f),t(f)\\in O_{\\mathrm{Sh}}\\},\\\\\nM_{\\mathrm{Sh}}^{(2)}&amp;\\coloneqq M^{(2)}\\cap M_{\\mathrm{Sh}}^2,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle O_{\\mathrm{Sh}},M_{\\mathrm{Sh}},s|_{M_{\\mathrm{Sh}}},t|_{M_{\\mathrm{Sh}}},e|_{O_{\\mathrm{Sh}}},c|_{M_{\\mathrm{Sh}}^{(2)}}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E))&amp;,\\qquad\n\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)(X,Y)=\\mathcal E(X,Y).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sheaf}_j(X)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall U,A)(\\forall m:U\\rightarrowtail A)\\bigl[\\mathrm{Dense}_j(m)\\Rightarrow\n(\\forall f:U\\to X)(\\exists!h:A\\to X)\\ hm=f\\bigr],\\\\\nO_{\\mathrm{Sh}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{X\\in O\\mid\\mathrm{Sheaf}_j(X)\\},\\\\\nM_{\\mathrm{Sh}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{f\\in M\\mid s(f),t(f)\\in O_{\\mathrm{Sh}}\\},\\\\\nM_{\\mathrm{Sh}}^{(2)}&amp;\\coloneqq M^{(2)}\\cap M_{\\mathrm{Sh}}^2,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle O_{\\mathrm{Sh}},M_{\\mathrm{Sh}},s|_{M_{\\mathrm{Sh}}},t|_{M_{\\mathrm{Sh}}},e|_{O_{\\mathrm{Sh}}},c|_{M_{\\mathrm{Sh}}^{(2)}}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E))&amp;,\\qquad\n\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)(X,Y)=\\mathcal E(X,Y).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>沿每个稠密单态射的限制映射，分离性要求单射，层性要求双射。满子范畴保留环境Hom与复合，因此范畴公理直接继承。来源 Definition5.7.1 pp.360–361 (PDF380–381)。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-separated","status":"resolved","id":"e3878d9cc72edc34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-separated]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-nucleus","status":"resolved","id":"7b9d7a3ecba84e9e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-nucleus]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"55e78399bad5fbe9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-nucleus","status":"resolved","id":"7b9d7a3ecba84e9e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 满足 [[16-df-nucleus]] 的 $\\mathrm{Nucleus}_\\Omega(j)$；$\\top:1\\to\\Omega$、$\\chi_m:A\\to\\Omega$ 采用 [[16-df-subobject-classifier]]。$\\top_A=\\top\\circ!_A$，$!_A$ 为唯一终态射。$X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"55e78399bad5fbe9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 满足 [[16-df-nucleus]] 的 $\\mathrm{Nucleus}_\\Omega(j)$；$\\top:1\\to\\Omega$、$\\chi_m:A\\to\\Omega$ 采用 [[16-df-subobject-classifier]]。$\\top_A=\\top\\circ!_A$，$!_A$ 为唯一终态射。$X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-separated","status":"resolved","id":"e3878d9cc72edc34","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Dense}_j$ 采用 [[16-df-separated]]。下文满子范畴的Hom只在其所定义对象上使用。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E=\\langle O,M,s,t,e,c\\rangle$ 采用 [[16-df-category]] 的六元组；$M^{(2)}=\\{(g,f)\\in M^2\\mid s(g)=t(f)\\}$。$X,Y$ 在满子范畴的 Hom 公式中取自 $O_{\\mathrm{Sh}}$；其箭头保留环境范畴的源、靶与复合。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Nucleus}_\\Omega(j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\top:1\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_m:A\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\top_A=\\top\\circ!_A","display":false},{"tex":"!_A","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dense}_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sheaf}_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E=\\langle O,M,s,t,e,c\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"M^{(2)}=\\{(g,f)\\in M^2\\mid s(g)=t(f)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"O_{\\mathrm{Sh}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sheaf}_j(X)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall U,A)(\\forall m:U\\rightarrowtail A)\\bigl[\\mathrm{Dense}_j(m)\\Rightarrow\n(\\forall f:U\\to X)(\\exists!h:A\\to X)\\ hm=f\\bigr],\\\\\nO_{\\mathrm{Sh}}&\\coloneqq\\{X\\in O\\mid\\mathrm{Sheaf}_j(X)\\},\\\\\nM_{\\mathrm{Sh}}&\\coloneqq\\{f\\in M\\mid s(f),t(f)\\in O_{\\mathrm{Sh}}\\},\\\\\nM_{\\mathrm{Sh}}^{(2)}&\\coloneqq M^{(2)}\\cap M_{\\mathrm{Sh}}^2,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)&\\coloneqq\n\\langle O_{\\mathrm{Sh}},M_{\\mathrm{Sh}},s|_{M_{\\mathrm{Sh}}},t|_{M_{\\mathrm{Sh}}},e|_{O_{\\mathrm{Sh}}},c|_{M_{\\mathrm{Sh}}^{(2)}}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E))&,\\qquad\n\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)(X,Y)=\\mathcal E(X,Y).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1982,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-327","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-sheaf|df-sheaf]]"},{"id":"512abfcc793a6632","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"628d5e147993792a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sheaf}_j$、$\\mathrm{Separated}_j$ 分别采用 [[16-df-sheaf]]、[[16-df-separated]]。"}],"outgoing":["e3878d9cc72edc34","7b9d7a3ecba84e9e","55e78399bad5fbe9","25a281534aa42440"]}